    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42669" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sartāgo</span></b> , ĭnis,
			f.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A frying-pan</i>, <i>baking-pan</i>
			(post-Aug.), <i><span class="en">Plin. 16, 11, 22, § 55</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 10,
			63</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ambros. Ep. 100, §
			9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Lev. 7, 9</span></i>.—*
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sartago loquendi,</span>”
				<i>a hotchpotch</i>, <i>mixture</i>, <i>medley</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					1, 80</span></i>
			.</div>
